<opsproc code="00008830.0005001" revdate="2018-11-15T11:16:04"><title>Lavatory and Galley Extraction Fan</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.004"><title>General Information</title><procbody lid="N.00008830.0005001.005"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.006"><para code="00008830.0005001.002" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.007">Two amber crosses replace the
cabin zone temperature indications on the <tech-label type="s-page">COND</tech-label>.</para><para code="00008830.0005001.003" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.008"><duref product="MMEL" ref="00007521"/></para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.009"><para code="00008830.0005001.004" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.010"> The INOP SYS column on the <tech-label type="s-page">STATUS</tech-label> may display the <emph bold="false" color="Amber" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="false">LAV DET</emph> message.</para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.011"><para code="00008830.0005001.005" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.012">The cabin zone temperature
regulation is lost.</para><para code="00008830.0005001.006" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.013">The Air
Conditioning System Controller commands <abb>FWD</abb> and
AFT cabin ducts temperature using the position of the <tech-label type="sel">FWD CABIN</tech-label> and the <tech-label type="sel">AFT CABIN</tech-label> on the AIR COND overhead panel.</para><para code="00008830.0005001.010" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.020">Slight effect on cabin comfort may occur.</para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.018"><para code="00008830.0005001.009" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.019">The cockpit temperature regulation is still operative.</para></inform></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.021"><title>During Cockpit Preparation</title><procbody lid="N.00008830.0005001.022"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.023"><para code="00008830.0005001.011" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.024">In the case of continuous operation
of the lavatory and galley extraction fan, or in the case of "burning
smell" associated with the inoperative lavatory and galley extraction
fan:</para></inform><action-block lid="N.00008830.0005001.025"><action layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0005001.026" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008830.0005001.012"><challenge><tech-label type="cb">AIR COND/LAV/GALLEY VENT
